{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "sqnyt8dqae9mksud", "title": "109.基于LoRA训练图像分类模型", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"S7DPq\" id=\"S7DPq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">示例代码</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"localdoc\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fzip%2F2424104%2F1746582257175-1f7d444b-3357-4950-bdd3-d86e210bc372.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22lora-train.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A22419%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u537dbc79-3eea-4393-8799-9742fa67383%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UiL79%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"NdRnQ\" id=\"NdRnQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"uceb298bd\" id=\"uceb298bd\" style=\"color: #000000\">前言</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u892ff374\" id=\"u892ff374\"><span data-lake-id=\"u09ba494e\" id=\"u09ba494e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">一种有效训练大型模型的常用方法是插入（通常在注意力模块中）较小的可训练矩阵，这些矩阵是在微调期间要学习的增量权重矩阵的低秩分解。预训练模型的原始权重矩阵被冻结，只有较小的矩阵在训练期间更新。这减少了可训练参数的数量，从而减少了内存使用和训练时间，对于大型模型来说，这可能非常昂贵。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b925cb0\" id=\"u0b925cb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue092f997\" id=\"ue092f997\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">有几种不同的方法可以将权重矩阵表示为低秩分解，但</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter#low-rank-adaptation-lora\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc633a848\" id=\"uc633a848\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57b2d374\" id=\"u57b2d374\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">低秩自适应 (LoRA)</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5ae07f17\" id=\"u5ae07f17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">是最常用的方法。PEFT 库支持其他几种 LoRA 变体，例如</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter#low-rank-hadamard-product-loha\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u755d8e97\" id=\"u755d8e97\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufdbb385f\" id=\"ufdbb385f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">低秩哈达玛积 (LoHa)</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue0beac08\" id=\"ue0beac08\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">、</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter#low-rank-kronecker-product-lokr\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3e6e6697\" id=\"u3e6e6697\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4bf87c9\" id=\"uf4bf87c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">低秩克罗内克积 (LoKr)</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7dbbe88a\" id=\"u7dbbe88a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter#adaptive-low-rank-adaptation-adalora\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u090495cf\" id=\"u090495cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e565058\" id=\"u0e565058\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">自适应低秩自适应 (AdaLoRA)</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u666cd73e\" id=\"u666cd73e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。您可以在</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u1540e6fc\" id=\"u1540e6fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude66aee8\" id=\"ude66aee8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">适配器</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uc9aafdcf\" id=\"uc9aafdcf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">指南中了解有关这些方法在概念上如何工作的更多信息。如果您有兴趣将这些方法应用于其他任务和用例，例如语义分割、token 分类，请查看我们的</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/collections/PEFT/notebooks-6573b28b33e5a4bf5b157fc1\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue2ac37a6\" id=\"ue2ac37a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe5cfedb\" id=\"ufe5cfedb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">notebook 合集</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uf4d1d9af\" id=\"uf4d1d9af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6fa35651\" id=\"u6fa35651\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ff73f08\" id=\"u5ff73f08\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">此外，PEFT 支持</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud99f68d6\" id=\"ud99f68d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter#mixture-of-lora-experts-x-lora\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u63aeb212\" id=\"u63aeb212\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60b89ac0\" id=\"u60b89ac0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">X-LoRA</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u331305ff\" id=\"u331305ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc30581d2\" id=\"uc30581d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">LoRA 专家混合方法。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf98cc86f\" id=\"uf98cc86f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0460087\" id=\"ua0460087\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">本指南将向您展示如何使用低秩分解方法快速训练图像分类模型，以识别图像中显示的食物类别。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud291305e\" id=\"ud291305e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fjpeg%2F2424104%2F1745994160271-6bf96f42-d989-4c37-bcb4-8075a7d62342.jpeg%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A275%2C%22originHeight%22%3A183%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%239eaaa0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jH6Ta%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u60e9664b\" id=\"u60e9664b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6eadce7f\" id=\"u6eadce7f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">熟悉图像分类模型训练的一般过程将非常有帮助，并使您能够专注于低秩分解方法。如果您是新手，我们建议您首先查看 Transformers 文档中的</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/tasks/image_classification\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u8b931a6c\" id=\"u8b931a6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43deedf0\" id=\"u43deedf0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">图像分类</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u0827c3b6\" id=\"u0827c3b6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">指南。当您准备好后，请回来看看将 PEFT 融入您的训练有多么容易！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u06c371a3\" id=\"u06c371a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe583e91\" id=\"ufe583e91\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">在开始之前，请确保您已安装所有必要的库。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4c87f10a\" id=\"u4c87f10a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4ec9ee6\" id=\"uf4ec9ee6\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">pip install -q peft transformers datasets</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"wzy4H\" id=\"wzy4H\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf1c9ce9\" id=\"uaf1c9ce9\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">数据集</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9f56752a\" id=\"u9f56752a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ff10b73\" id=\"u4ff10b73\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">在本指南中，您将使用包含 101 个食物类别的图像的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u985e673a\" id=\"u985e673a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/datasets/food101\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u36f9e37a\" id=\"u36f9e37a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bcd9e68\" id=\"u3bcd9e68\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Food-101</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8784c130\" id=\"u8784c130\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u672f7e45\" id=\"u672f7e45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">数据集（查看</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/datasets/food101/viewer/default/train\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u69b5b005\" id=\"u69b5b005\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80cce866\" id=\"u80cce866\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">数据集查看器</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5cdd93d4\" id=\"u5cdd93d4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，以更好地了解数据集的外观）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7915e1f7\" id=\"u7915e1f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud44b1fed\" id=\"ud44b1fed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u14e1e44f\" id=\"u14e1e44f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/datasets/v3.4.1/en/package_reference/loading_methods#datasets.load_dataset\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua1ad37db\" id=\"ua1ad37db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75e94bac\" id=\"u75e94bac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">load_dataset</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1935e15f\" id=\"u1935e15f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1a3a01c6\" id=\"u1a3a01c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数加载数据集。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20datasets%20import%20load_dataset%5Cn%5Cnds%20%3D%20load_dataset(%5C%22food101%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L4xT4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue0005960\" id=\"ue0005960\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44b92ea8\" id=\"u44b92ea8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">每个食物类别都用一个整数标记，为了更容易理解这些整数代表什么，您将创建一个</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8f992e2f\" id=\"u8f992e2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7bb847d3\" id=\"u7bb847d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee00aec1\" id=\"uee00aec1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">label2id</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9da3e98e\" id=\"u9da3e98e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uf9aabaf6\" id=\"uf9aabaf6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8892d14d\" id=\"u8892d14d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7fa06843\" id=\"u7fa06843\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee9d4366\" id=\"uee9d4366\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">id2label</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u46d30da8\" id=\"u46d30da8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u88328ece\" id=\"u88328ece\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">字典，将整数映射到其类别标签。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22labels%20%3D%20ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D.features%5B%5C%22label%5C%22%5D.names%5Cnlabel2id%2C%20id2label%20%3D%20dict()%2C%20dict()%5Cnfor%20i%2C%20label%20in%20enumerate(labels)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20label2id%5Blabel%5D%20%3D%20i%5Cn%20%20%20%20id2label%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20label%5Cn%5Cnid2label%5B2%5D%5Cn%5C%22baklava%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DnK7s%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufde11cb2\" id=\"ufde11cb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8006714b\" id=\"u8006714b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">加载图像处理器以正确调整大小并标准化训练和评估图像的像素值。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoImageProcessor%5Cn%5Cnimage_processor%20%3D%20AutoImageProcessor.from_pretrained(%5C%22google%2Fvit-base-patch16-224-in21k%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p2h4B%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u93851e1c\" id=\"u93851e1c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8389e738\" id=\"u8389e738\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">您还可以使用图像处理器来准备一些用于数据增强和像素缩放的转换函数。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20torchvision.transforms%20import%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20CenterCrop%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20Compose%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20Normalize%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20RandomHorizontalFlip%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20RandomResizedCrop%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20Resize%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20ToTensor%2C%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cnnormalize%20%3D%20Normalize(mean%3Dimage_processor.image_mean%2C%20std%3Dimage_processor.image_std)%5Cntrain_transforms%20%3D%20Compose(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20RandomResizedCrop(image_processor.size%5B%5C%22height%5C%22%5D)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20RandomHorizontalFlip()%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ToTensor()%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20normalize%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5D%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cnval_transforms%20%3D%20Compose(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Resize(image_processor.size%5B%5C%22height%5C%22%5D)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20CenterCrop(image_processor.size%5B%5C%22height%5C%22%5D)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ToTensor()%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20normalize%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5D%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cndef%20preprocess_train(example_batch)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20example_batch%5B%5C%22pixel_values%5C%22%5D%20%3D%20%5Btrain_transforms(image.convert(%5C%22RGB%5C%22))%20for%20image%20in%20example_batch%5B%5C%22image%5C%22%5D%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20example_batch%5Cn%5Cndef%20preprocess_val(example_batch)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20example_batch%5B%5C%22pixel_values%5C%22%5D%20%3D%20%5Bval_transforms(image.convert(%5C%22RGB%5C%22))%20for%20image%20in%20example_batch%5B%5C%22image%5C%22%5D%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20example_batch%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KQPB5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u60103eb4\" id=\"u60103eb4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9213a067\" id=\"u9213a067\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">定义训练和验证数据集，并使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u07b5a2cd\" id=\"u07b5a2cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/datasets/v3.4.1/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.Dataset.set_transform\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u1e10341b\" id=\"u1e10341b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a7264bb\" id=\"u2a7264bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">set_transform</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u877dbf34\" id=\"u877dbf34\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"udff71ce3\" id=\"udff71ce3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数即时应用转换。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22train_ds%20%3D%20ds%5B%5C%22train%5C%22%5D%5Cnval_ds%20%3D%20ds%5B%5C%22validation%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cntrain_ds.set_transform(preprocess_train)%5Cnval_ds.set_transform(preprocess_val)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sMY8Z%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc128069f\" id=\"uc128069f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a2374ca\" id=\"u8a2374ca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">最后，您需要一个数据整理器来创建一批训练和评估数据，并将标签转换为</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6a566f2f\" id=\"u6a566f2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf1ed936e\" id=\"uf1ed936e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u362c4cb3\" id=\"u362c4cb3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">torch.tensor</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32b73790\" id=\"u32b73790\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc0263cdc\" id=\"uc0263cdc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">对象。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cn%5Cndef%20collate_fn(examples)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20pixel_values%20%3D%20torch.stack(%5Bexample%5B%5C%22pixel_values%5C%22%5D%20for%20example%20in%20examples%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20labels%20%3D%20torch.tensor(%5Bexample%5B%5C%22label%5C%22%5D%20for%20example%20in%20examples%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%5C%22pixel_values%5C%22%3A%20pixel_values%2C%20%5C%22labels%5C%22%3A%20labels%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HVq0w%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"qPvK2\" id=\"qPvK2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaed459fc\" id=\"uaed459fc\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u98522613\" id=\"u98522613\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45b3b4fd\" id=\"u45b3b4fd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">现在让我们加载一个预训练模型用作基础模型。本指南使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ubd9a7a9b\" id=\"ubd9a7a9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/google/vit-base-patch16-224-in21k\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf6cdb89c\" id=\"uf6cdb89c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc213d37\" id=\"ufc213d37\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">google/vit-base-patch16-224-in21k</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ucd26f61a\" id=\"ucd26f61a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u651b1327\" id=\"u651b1327\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">模型，但您可以使用任何您想要的图像分类模型。将</span><span data-lake-id=\"u40700ee8\" id=\"u40700ee8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7bd2ee9f\" id=\"u7bd2ee9f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7db58c72\" id=\"u7db58c72\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">label2id</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u074834db\" id=\"u074834db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u3b8c56a8\" id=\"u3b8c56a8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1be1fdaf\" id=\"u1be1fdaf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc12786dd\" id=\"uc12786dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ab4c92f\" id=\"u0ab4c92f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">id2label</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u24f8a93f\" id=\"u24f8a93f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u65affec9\" id=\"u65affec9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">字典传递给模型，以便模型知道如何将整数标签映射到其类别标签，如果您要微调已经微调过的检查点，您可以选择传递</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4a9496df\" id=\"u4a9496df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u093cbc6a\" id=\"u093cbc6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36f5f04f\" id=\"u36f5f04f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">ignore_mismatched_sizes=True</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue2501e8b\" id=\"ue2501e8b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u277e3e8b\" id=\"u277e3e8b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">参数。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForImageClassification%2C%20TrainingArguments%2C%20Trainer%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForImageClassification.from_pretrained(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22google%2Fvit-base-patch16-224-in21k%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20label2id%3Dlabel2id%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20id2label%3Did2label%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20ignore_mismatched_sizes%3DTrue%2C%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pKBC3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"s0urB\" id=\"s0urB\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5cb36380\" id=\"u5cb36380\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">PEFT 配置和模型</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc55cbd07\" id=\"uc55cbd07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u269a38e7\" id=\"u269a38e7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">每个 PEFT 方法都需要一个配置，其中包含指定应如何应用 PEFT 方法的所有参数。配置设置完成后，将其与基础模型一起传递给</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua7ccbfe7\" id=\"ua7ccbfe7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.get_peft_model\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u79c81f54\" id=\"u79c81f54\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1be527f\" id=\"ue1be527f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">get_peft_model()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ucf2b084a\" id=\"ucf2b084a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u63f14209\" id=\"u63f14209\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数，以创建一个可训练的</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue759ead0\" id=\"ue759ead0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue44b1511\" id=\"ue44b1511\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufab20ffa\" id=\"ufab20ffa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u988b12e1\" id=\"u988b12e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udab18123\" id=\"udab18123\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4d93095\" id=\"ud4d93095\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">调用 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel.print_trainable_parameters\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3501de21\" id=\"u3501de21\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb769802\" id=\"udb769802\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">print_trainable_parameters()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6683e386\" id=\"u6683e386\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> 方法，比较 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uba84d3aa\" id=\"uba84d3aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b992012\" id=\"u2b992012\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5cf82d9f\" id=\"u5cf82d9f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> 的参数数量与基础模型中的参数数量！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf9276007\" id=\"uf9276007\"><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/adapter#low-rank-adaptation-lora\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud8f8ffa1\" id=\"ud8f8ffa1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue86f3d93\" id=\"ue86f3d93\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">LoRA</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u9045d516\" id=\"u9045d516\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ue1dc606e\" id=\"ue1dc606e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">将权重更新矩阵分解为*两个*较小的矩阵。这些低秩矩阵的大小由其*秩*或</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8b43f2c9\" id=\"u8b43f2c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u89d56f0c\" id=\"u89d56f0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud78d2ae9\" id=\"ud78d2ae9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">r</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5c0a9912\" id=\"u5c0a9912\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u25f19d6b\" id=\"u25f19d6b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">决定。秩越高意味着模型有更多的参数要训练，但也意味着模型具有更强的学习能力。您还需要指定</span><span data-lake-id=\"u90ff70bd\" id=\"u90ff70bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ued4c4dad\" id=\"ued4c4dad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u347f6873\" id=\"u347f6873\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">target_modules</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue5c77796\" id=\"ue5c77796\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，它确定较小矩阵的插入位置。在本指南中，您将以注意力模块的*query*和*value*矩阵为目标。其他要设置的重要参数包括</span><span data-lake-id=\"u39590aea\" id=\"u39590aea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4c5af304\" id=\"u4c5af304\"><span data-lake-id=\"uacd9b307\" id=\"uacd9b307\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">lora_alpha</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4ee64fa6\" id=\"u4ee64fa6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">（缩放因子）、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6772327d\" id=\"u6772327d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u236761cb\" id=\"u236761cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">bias</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua0af5eb3\" id=\"ua0af5eb3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">（</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4993f6ce\" id=\"u4993f6ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3362e92\" id=\"uf3362e92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">none</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4f5bd404\" id=\"u4f5bd404\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3b1f934c\" id=\"u3b1f934c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d2ed73a\" id=\"u7d2ed73a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">all</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue0b79be7\" id=\"ue0b79be7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7a99a7b5\" id=\"u7a99a7b5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">还是仅训练 LoRA 偏差参数），以及</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud13b457c\" id=\"ud13b457c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u947fd8a9\" id=\"u947fd8a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f10f9a0\" id=\"u2f10f9a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">modules_to_save</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u16ad577f\" id=\"u16ad577f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">（除了要训练和保存的 LoRA 层之外的模块）。所有这些参数以及更多参数都可以在</span><span data-lake-id=\"u065be564\" id=\"u065be564\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/lora#peft.LoraConfig\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udd03f4b2\" id=\"udd03f4b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a1fd5af\" id=\"u7a1fd5af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">LoraConfig</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u85b431cd\" id=\"u85b431cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ueb9dd712\" id=\"ueb9dd712\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">中找到。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20LoraConfig%2C%20get_peft_model%5Cn%5Cnconfig%20%3D%20LoraConfig(%5Cn%20%20%20%20r%3D16%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20lora_alpha%3D16%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20target_modules%3D%5B%5C%22query%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22value%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20lora_dropout%3D0.1%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20bias%3D%5C%22none%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20modules_to_save%3D%5B%5C%22classifier%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20get_peft_model(model%2C%20config)%5Cnmodel.print_trainable_parameters()%5Cn%5C%22trainable%20params%3A%20667%2C493%20%7C%7C%20all%20params%3A%2086%2C543%2C818%20%7C%7C%20trainable%25%3A%200.7712775047664294%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BtMpb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"BGxi9\" id=\"BGxi9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue12994ee\" id=\"ue12994ee\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">训练</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u0ec15e55\" id=\"u0ec15e55\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb07dc12\" id=\"ubb07dc12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">对于训练，让我们使用 Transformers 中的</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf171fda6\" id=\"uf171fda6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/trainer#transformers.Trainer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uec644ea3\" id=\"uec644ea3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dfd7082\" id=\"u7dfd7082\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Trainer</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u9ce2e937\" id=\"u9ce2e937\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u27e22677\" id=\"u27e22677\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">类。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u39102813\" id=\"u39102813\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4f25b02\" id=\"ue4f25b02\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">Trainer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uad3c8731\" id=\"uad3c8731\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u541e6438\" id=\"u541e6438\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">包含一个 PyTorch 训练循环，当您准备好后，调用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u84c08158\" id=\"u84c08158\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/trainer#transformers.Trainer.train\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2f9473df\" id=\"u2f9473df\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua36e331a\" id=\"ua36e331a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">train</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub29e5786\" id=\"ub29e5786\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u63efeafa\" id=\"u63efeafa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">开始训练。要自定义训练运行，请在</span><span data-lake-id=\"u05cf1cf7\" id=\"u05cf1cf7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/trainer#transformers.TrainingArguments\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u60aa3cb8\" id=\"u60aa3cb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue19c7177\" id=\"ue19c7177\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">TrainingArguments</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u47e608b4\" id=\"u47e608b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u90208798\" id=\"u90208798\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">类中配置训练超参数。使用类似 LoRA 的方法，您可以负担得起使用更高的批量大小和学习率。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u06c0d698\" id=\"u06c0d698\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca6bf940\" id=\"uca6bf940\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">AdaLoRA 有一个</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf8fa0ac2\" id=\"uf8fa0ac2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/adalora#peft.AdaLoraModel.update_and_allocate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u91cdc686\" id=\"u91cdc686\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9829521\" id=\"uc9829521\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">update_and_allocate()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u194941ee\" id=\"u194941ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u5ce061e0\" id=\"u5ce061e0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">方法，应在每个训练步骤中调用该方法以更新参数预算和掩码，否则不会执行自适应步骤。这需要编写自定义训练循环或子类化</span><span data-lake-id=\"u35a66de3\" id=\"u35a66de3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/trainer#transformers.Trainer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3baa4bc7\" id=\"u3baa4bc7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c7aff9e\" id=\"u9c7aff9e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">Trainer</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u88a6f9fc\" id=\"u88a6f9fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u34d9cd19\" id=\"u34d9cd19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">以合并此方法。例如，请查看这个</span><span data-lake-id=\"ufa4c6358\" id=\"ufa4c6358\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/peft/blob/912ad41e96e03652cabf47522cd876076f7a0c4f/examples/conditional_generation/peft_adalora_seq2seq.py#L120\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2fa10266\" id=\"u2fa10266\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b50665e\" id=\"u7b50665e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">自定义训练循环</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5f4e58dd\" id=\"u5f4e58dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20TrainingArguments%2C%20Trainer%5Cn%5Cnaccount%20%3D%20%5C%22stevhliu%5C%22%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20f%5C%22%7Baccount%7D%2Fgoogle%2Fvit-base-patch16-224-in21k-lora%5C%22%5Cnbatch_size%20%3D%20128%5Cn%5Cnargs%20%3D%20TrainingArguments(%5Cn%20%20%20%20peft_model_id%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20remove_unused_columns%3DFalse%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_strategy%3D%5C%22epoch%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20save_strategy%3D%5C%22epoch%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20learning_rate%3D5e-3%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20per_device_train_batch_size%3Dbatch_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20gradient_accumulation_steps%3D4%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20per_device_eval_batch_size%3Dbatch_size%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20fp16%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20num_train_epochs%3D5%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20logging_steps%3D10%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20load_best_model_at_end%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20label_names%3D%5B%5C%22labels%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mp2l8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6cc1fde6\" id=\"u6cc1fde6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6f41202\" id=\"ud6f41202\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u46863ef2\" id=\"u46863ef2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/trainer#transformers.Trainer.train\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4b63076d\" id=\"u4b63076d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ea47ddc\" id=\"u5ea47ddc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">train</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue7040c96\" id=\"ue7040c96\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9799f40f\" id=\"u9799f40f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">开始训练。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22trainer%20%3D%20Trainer(%5Cn%20%20%20%20model%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_dataset%3Dtrain_ds%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20eval_dataset%3Dval_ds%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20tokenizer%3Dimage_processor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20data_collator%3Dcollate_fn%2C%5Cn)%5Cntrainer.train()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yq5jb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"jzkH5\" id=\"jzkH5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uefccc43c\" id=\"uefccc43c\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">分享你的模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uef8c387e\" id=\"uef8c387e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36b338d8\" id=\"u36b338d8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">训练完成后，您可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8d2b34f8\" id=\"u8d2b34f8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/model#transformers.PreTrainedModel.push_to_hub\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7b80bb12\" id=\"u7b80bb12\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2bd4abfa\" id=\"u2bd4abfa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">push_to_hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u510b10a9\" id=\"u510b10a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub0df6023\" id=\"ub0df6023\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法将您的模型上传到 Hub。您需要先登录您的 Hugging Face 帐户，并在提示时输入您的令牌。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20huggingface_hub%20import%20notebook_login%5Cn%5Cnnotebook_login()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%